</code></pre> <pre><code>print("Hello from Python")
</code></pre> <p>Tabs can hold any content — prose, lists, admonitions:</p> <p>Inside a tab</p> <p>Admonitions nest inside tabs just fine.</p>

Method Purpose <code>GetComponent&lt;T&gt;()</code> Returns the component of type <code>T</code>, or <code>null</code> if the entity does not have one. <code>HasComponent&lt;T&gt;()</code> <code>true</code> if the entity has a component of type <code>T</code>. <code>CreateComponent&lt;T&gt;()</code> Adds and returns a new component of type <code>T</code>. <code>RemoveComponent&lt;T&gt;()</code> Removes the component of type <code>T</code>. <p><code>GetComponent&lt;T&gt;()</code> returns a nullable reference, so check before using it:</p> <pre><code>protected override void OnCreate()
{
    m_Mesh = GetComponent&lt;MeshComponent&gt;();
    if (m_Mesh is null)
        return;

    // ... configure m_Mesh
}
</code></pre> <p>Cache components in <code>OnCreate</code> rather than calling <code>GetComponent</code> every frame.</p>
